MidPoint 4.10 "Braille" Update 4
--------------------------------

Release 4.10.4 is an eighty-second midPoint release code-named Braille.
The 4.10.4 release brings security, stability and miscellaneous bug fixes.

Release date: 20st August 2026
Release type: Maintenance release
End of support: 25th November 2027

Please see the release notes for detailed list of changes:
https://docs.evolveum.com/midpoint/release/4.10.4/
